From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:24:58 -0700
Subject: Reinsert PatternData into pattern map after reconstruction
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

LayoutSVGResourcePattern::pattern_map_ can be cleared while executing
BuildPatternData, so be sure it reinsert the newly-created pattern
data rather than using the (possibly stale) previous hash table
AddResult.

Fixed: 565742179
Change-Id: Iad113e3101920adf4b56da4805b4a46ebf681730
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8464440
Reviewed-by: Fredrik Söderquist <fs@opera.com>
Commit-Queue: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1706535}

Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y):
  - M148 has no PatternData::paint_flags member and BuildPatternData() takes
    only the reference box, so the paint_flags comparison/reset and the
    paint_flags argument from the upstream hunk are omitted. The map
    lookup/reinsert logic (find, build, Set) is otherwise verbatim.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/svg/layout_svg_resource_pattern.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/svg/layout_svg_resource_pattern.cc
index 90c2de36d0841d00a50d105e6bdf55489cf511da..d44549831e9f10f96c34c39592a9a88e03075119 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/svg/layout_svg_resource_pattern.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/svg/layout_svg_resource_pattern.cc
@@ -188,10 +188,15 @@ bool LayoutSVGResourcePattern::ApplyShader(
   NOT_DESTROYED();
   ClearInvalidationMask();
 
-  std::unique_ptr<PatternData>& pattern_data =
-      pattern_map_.insert(&client, nullptr).stored_value->value;
-  if (!pattern_data)
-    pattern_data = BuildPatternData(reference_box);
+  auto iter = pattern_map_.find(&client);
+  PatternData* pattern_data =
+      (iter == pattern_map_.end() ? nullptr : iter->value.get());
+  if (!pattern_data) {
+    auto new_pattern_data = BuildPatternData(reference_box);
+    pattern_data = new_pattern_data.get();
+    CHECK(pattern_data);
+    pattern_map_.Set(&client, std::move(new_pattern_data));
+  }
 
   if (!pattern_data->pattern)
     return false;
